## Conventions (project-specific)

### Naming
- Workflows: `{{project-prefix}}-{{purpose}}-v{{N}}` (e.g., `kpi-daily-sync-v2`)
- Tags: `{{project}}:{{tier}}`
- Node names: descriptive (not "HTTP Request" → "Get User Profile")

### Code nodes
- Default language: JavaScript (trừ khi spec nói Python)
- Use `$helpers.httpRequest` cho HTTP (JS)
- Use `DateTime` cho Luxon
- Always `await` async

### Error handling
- Tất cả HTTP/DB nodes PHẢI có `onError` config
- Retry 3 lần cho transient errors (`retryOnFail: true, maxTries: 3`)
- Error workflow reference: `{{ERROR_WORKFLOW_ID}}`

## Build/Deploy Commands

```bash
# Validate local
node D:/Projects/work/build-workflow/_pipeline/validate.js workflow/<file>.json

# Backup workflow
n8nctl workflow backup <id> --out _backups/

# Deploy
n8nctl workflow update <id> --file workflow/<file>.json

# Test
n8nctl workflow trigger <id> --input test-data.json

# Rollback
# (auto via /n8n-rollback command)
```

## Testing

### Test data
- Location: `./test-data/` (fixture inputs)
- Format: JSON matching expected webhook/trigger payload

### Test gate (Cần + Đủ)
- **Cần**: Workflow executes without error
- **Đủ**: Output matches expected schema + business logic correct

### Manual test checklist
- [ ] Webhook trigger responds correctly
- [ ] Happy path produces expected output
- [ ] Error path routes to error handler
- [ ] Rate limit handled (if external API)

